Astro component with a plain <script> (not is:inline): Astro bundles it and security.csp adds its hash, so no nonce is needed, and 'strict-dynamic' trusts the Google tag script it creates. Render <ConsentBanner /> once in the shared layout (before </body>). Replace the two directive strings in astro.config.mjs (security.csp.directives) so the analytics beacons are allowed. List `consent` in the project's essentialCookies.

